    "description": "Relo Group, Inc. provides property management services in Japan. The company is involved in the leased corporate housing management business, including consulting on dormitories and corporate housing, unattended house management services, rental brokerage, and other real estate services. It also offers global relocation support services, such as consulting and training regarding overseas transfers and business trips, support for the acceptance of foreign employees, and services related to overseas transfer regulations and compensation; solutions for HR activities; research, sales, and consulting on various indices; and serviced apartment operation and management. In addition, the company provides consulting of fringe benefit and customer treatment, immediate living assistance, outsourcing, and travel services, as well as consulting for insurance. Further, it operates resorts, hotels, vacation homes, lodging facilities, and rental meeting rooms. The company was formerly known as Relo Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to Relo Group, Inc. in July 2016. Relo Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1967 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
